---------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY ASSETS — READ THIS BEFORE REDISTRIBUTING
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT terms above cover the scripts, JavaScript, and documentation in this
repository, including the vendored wallpaper
`assets/wallpapers/wavy_lines_v02_5120x2880.png`. That image is not a third-party
asset: it is produced by `scripts/make-wallpaper.py`, which is part of this
repository and derives it from constants in that file, so its provenance is
verifiable rather than asserted. Run `./scripts/make-wallpaper.py --check` to
confirm the committed PNG still matches the generator.

Everything else this project *uses* is not bundled here and keeps its own
license: the Orchis look-and-feel/color schemes, the FairyWren icon themes, the
Bibata cursor theme, and the Orchis SDDM login theme are obtained from their
upstream packages or cloned at install time by
`scripts/install-sddm-orchis.sh`. See those projects for their terms (Orchis is
GPL-3.0).
